{"id":"0ae924f79f9fa3bb","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-geometric-deduction-soundness.md","title":"Theorem — 几何序列演绎的可靠性","display":"Theorem — 几何序列演绎的可靠性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-geometric-deduction-soundness","aliases":["14-thm-geometric-deduction-soundness"],"display":"Theorem — 几何序列演绎的可靠性","depends_on":["[[14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction]]","[[14-df-first-order-categorical-semantics]]","[[14-df-geometric-theory-models]]","[[14-thm-categorical-substitution-lemma]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-geometric-deduction-soundness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-geometric-deduction-soundness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 几何序列演绎的可靠性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f9eae1f4309444c6\" href=\"?note=f9eae1f4309444c6\" title=\"14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction\">14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c22badb838a7fca1\" href=\"?note=c22badb838a7fca1\" title=\"14-df-first-order-categorical-semantics\">14-df-first-order-categorical-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b995af55a8b210ce\" href=\"?note=b995af55a8b210ce\" title=\"14-df-geometric-theory-models\">14-df-geometric-theory-models</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"659a7609f5640bba\" href=\"?note=659a7609f5640bba\" title=\"14-thm-categorical-substitution-lemma\">14-thm-categorical-substitution-lemma</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb T\">\\(\\mathbb T\\)</span>、序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi\">\\(\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi\\)</span> 及演绎规则见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f9eae1f4309444c6\" href=\"?note=f9eae1f4309444c6\" title=\"14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction\">14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 是初等拓扑斯 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb T\">\\(\\mathbb T\\)</span>-模型，解释见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c22badb838a7fca1\" href=\"?note=c22badb838a7fca1\" title=\"14-df-first-order-categorical-semantics\">14-df-first-order-categorical-semantics</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Provable}_{\\mathrm{Geo}}(\\mathbb T,\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi)\\Rightarrow⟦\\varphi⟧_{M,\\vec x}\\le⟦\\psi⟧_{M,\\vec x}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Provable}_{\\mathrm{Geo}}(\\mathbb T,\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi)\\Rightarrow⟦\\varphi⟧_{M,\\vec x}\\le⟦\\psi⟧_{M,\\vec x}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：对有限推导树归纳。恒等、切规则由偏序；合取、析取规则由格普遍性质；存在左右规则由 ∃p⊣p*；分配律由子对象 Heyting 格，存在 Frobenius 由像与拉回的 Frobenius 恒等式；α 改名由约束变量重标号不变性；替换由<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"659a7609f5640bba\" href=\"?note=659a7609f5640bba\" title=\"14-thm-categorical-substitution-lemma\">14-thm-categorical-substitution-lemma</a>；等号反身与替换由对角子对象的普遍性质。理论叶节点正是模型条件。此证明只需有穷语法，不使用任意小上确界。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction","status":"resolved","id":"f9eae1f4309444c6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","locatio