ts":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb T","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Provable}_{\\mathrm{Geo}}(\\mathbb T,\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi)\\Rightarrow⟦\\varphi⟧_{M,\\vec x}\\le⟦\\psi⟧_{M,\\vec x}.","display":true}],"bytes":1389,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-221","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-geometric-deduction-soundness|Theorem — 几何序列演绎的可靠性]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-212","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-geometric-deduction-soundness]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-222","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-geometric-deduction-soundness|Theorem — 几何序列演绎的可靠性]]"},{"id":"50ccfcdcd428a34e","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"依据原书 X.5 的 Gentzen 语法站点构造及 X.7 的泛模型判据整理。正向由 [[14-thm-geometric-deduction-soundness]] 的规则归纳；逆向取语法分类拓扑斯的泛模型，可表对象的包含由 Yoneda 全忠实性还原为语法序列可导。原稿缺上下文和结论公式，并用未定义的 Geo 可证谓词，已补闭合。"}],"outgoing":["f9eae1f4309444c6","c22badb838a7fca1","b995af55a8b210ce","659a7609f5640bba"]}